{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01APvX6xHjvGqRANDUMp22ry","type":"tool_result","content":"   162→### 1.3 Score Diff Detection\n   163→\n   164→```javascript\n   165→// Pseudocode for score change detection\n   166→// NOTE: gymnast.final_score is a STRING (e.g., \"14.500\"), not a number\n   167→// Uses gymnast_id as primary key (already used in output.html:4490 for leaderboard)\n   168→previousScores = {}  // { \"gymnast_id\": \"finalScore\" (string) }\n   169→\n   170→onPoll(newData):\n   171→  changedPaths = {}  // Track what changed for incremental Firebase write\n   172→\n   173→  for each team in newData.teams:\n   174→    for each event in team.events:\n   175→      for each gymnast in event.gymnasts:\n   176→        // Primary key: gymnast_id. Fallback: team.short_name|normalizeName(full_name)\n   177→        key = gymnast.gymnast_id || `${team.short_name}|${normalizeName(gymnast.full_name)}`\n   178→        prevScore = previousScores[key]\n   179→        currScore = gymnast.final_score  // string or null\n   180→\n   181→        if currScore != null AND prevScore != currScore:\n   182→          // New score OR corrected score\n   183→          if isFlashActive(team, key):\n   184→            // Correction during active flash — interrupt immediately\n   185→            interruptFlash(team, gymnast, event)  // replaces current flash, resets timer\n   186→          else:\n   187→            triggerScoreFlash(team, gymnast, event)  // queued per-team\n   188→          changedPaths[`teams/${teamKey}/events/${eventKey}/gymnasts/${key}`] = gymnast\n   189→\n   190→        if currScore == null AND prevScore != null:\n   191→          // Score removed (rare, inquiry pending) — update total but no flash\n   192→          changedPaths[`teams/${teamKey}/events/${eventKey}/gymnasts/${key}`] = gymnast\n   193→\n   194→    // Check if team total changed\n   195→    if team.final_score != previousTeamTotals[teamKey]:\n   196→      changedPaths[`teams/${teamKey}/finalScore`] = team.final_score\n   197→\n   198→  // Write ONLY changed paths to Firebase (incremental delta, not full rewrite)\n   199→  if Object.keys(changedPaths).length > 0:\n   200→    firebase.update('scoreBug/liveData/', changedPaths)\n   201→    firebase.update('scoreBug/liveData/', { lastDataChangeTimestamp: Date.now(), stalePollCount: 0 })\n   202→  else:\n   203→    firebase.update('scoreBug/liveData/', { stalePollCount: increment, lastPollTimestamp: Date.now() })\n   204→\n   205→  // Always write heartbeat\n   206→  firebase.set('scoreBug/heartbeat', Date.now())\n   207→  previousScores = buildScoreMap(newData)\n   208→```\n   209→\n   210→### 1.4 \"Now Competing\" Detection\n   211→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d5acadc-34bc-4b7c-873d-83ef1cfd2a3f","uuid":"e14a5c21-a0e2-4a0e-a066-cd333f3dc22c","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/juliacosmiano/code/gymnastics-graphics/docs/PRD-Team-Scores-Bug/PLAN-Team-Scores-Bug-2026-01-31.md","content":"### 1.3 Score Diff Detection\n\n```javascript\n// Pseudocode for score change detection\n// NOTE: gymnast.final_score is a STRING (e.g., \"14.500\"), not a number\n// Uses gymnast_id as primary key (already used in output.html:4490 for leaderboard)\npreviousScores = {}  // { \"gymnast_id\": \"finalScore\" (string) }\n\nonPoll(newData):\n  changedPaths = {}  // Track what changed for incremental Firebase write\n\n  for each team in newData.teams:\n    for each event in team.events:\n      for each gymnast in event.gymnasts:\n        // Primary key: gymnast_id. Fallback: team.short_name|normalizeName(full_name)\n        key = gymnast.gymnast_id || `${team.short_name}|${normalizeName(gymnast.full_name)}`\n        prevScore = previousScores[key]\n        currScore = gymnast.final_score  // string or null\n\n        if currScore != null AND prevScore != currScore:\n          // New score OR corrected score\n          if isFlashActive(team, key):\n            // Correction during active flash — interrupt immediately\n            interruptFlash(team, gymnast, event)  // replaces current flash, resets timer\n          else:\n            triggerScoreFlash(team, gymnast, event)  // queued per-team\n          changedPaths[`teams/${teamKey}/events/${eventKey}/gymnasts/${key}`] = gymnast\n\n        if currScore == null AND prevScore != null:\n          // Score removed (rare, inquiry pending) — update total but no flash\n          changedPaths[`teams/${teamKey}/events/${eventKey}/gymnasts/${key}`] = gymnast\n\n    // Check if team total changed\n    if team.final_score != previousTeamTotals[teamKey]:\n      changedPaths[`teams/${teamKey}/finalScore`] = team.final_score\n\n  // Write ONLY changed paths to Firebase (incremental delta, not full rewrite)\n  if Object.keys(changedPaths).length > 0:\n    firebase.update('scoreBug/liveData/', changedPaths)\n    firebase.update('scoreBug/liveData/', { lastDataChangeTimestamp: Date.now(), stalePollCount: 0 })\n  else:\n    firebase.update('scoreBug/liveData/', { stalePollCount: increment, lastPollTimestamp: Date.now() })\n\n  // Always write heartbeat\n  firebase.set('scoreBug/heartbeat', Date.now())\n  previousScores = buildScoreMap(newData)\n```\n\n### 1.4 \"Now Competing\" Detection\n","numLines":50,"startLine":162,"totalLines":466}}}
