{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01VVM8wermm9jcgKAXVXRDdu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The CSS for the lineup card is already fully implemented. The HTML structure already has the placeholder div. C1 appears to be **already complete**. Let me verify by looking at the complete lineup card CSS:\n\n- `.lineup-card` - container with slide-up animation (lines 245-255)\n- `.lineup-card.visible` - shown state (lines 257-260)\n- `.lineup-header` - team name + logo header (lines 262-268)\n- `.lineup-team-name` - team name styling (lines 270-275)\n- `.lineup-logo` - team logo in header (lines 277-281)\n- `.lineup-athletes` - athletes list container (lines 283-285)\n- `.lineup-athlete` - individual athlete row (lines 287-292)\n- `.lineup-order` - lineup order number (lines 294-299)\n- `.lineup-name` - athlete name (lines 301-306)\n- `.lineup-sv` - start value (lines 308-314)\n- `.lineup-score` - score value (lines 316-326)\n- `.lineup-footer` - event + total footer (lines 328-334)\n- `.lineup-event` - event name (lines 336-341)\n- `.lineup-total` - event total (lines 343-347)\n\nThis exactly matches the PRD wireframe:\n```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Navy                           [N]  │  <- .lineup-header\n├──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  1. Kody Tokunaga       4.4  13.300  │  <- .lineup-athlete (order, name, sv, score)\n│  2. Matthew Petros      4.5  11.850  │\n...\n├──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  [event]              [event total]  │  <- .lineup-footer\n└──────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\nC1 is already complete! Let me update the PLAN:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":891,"cache_read_input_tokens":49211,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":891},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_man