{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01Vgy2oVckULyqb6Q1bCSKLA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The overlay stores team data in `state.teams`. In the producer panel, I can see the teams from `detected.nowCompeting` but that only shows currently competing athletes. \n\nFor the dismiss flash button, I think the cleanest approach is to add dismiss buttons alongside each team in the now-competing section since that's where the producer is looking at team-specific controls. But flashes can happen even when no one is currently competing (e.g., final scores coming in).\n\nLooking back at the requirements - the dismiss button should probably be:\n1. Per-team buttons that dismiss that team's flash\n2. Or a single \"Dismiss All\" button\n\nLet me implement per-team dismiss buttons. I'll add them based on the detected now-competing data since that's where team info is available. I'll also add a \"Dismiss All Flashes\" button at the top of the section as a convenience."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":699,"cache_read_input_tokens":36561,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":699},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"af9e7b0b-717a-4523-8596-08397b416ec3","uuid":"40e63a97-df0c-42bc-bd24-d0524ee69642"}
