{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JceYTBmnWG71kXRfozJCan","type":"tool_result","content":"  1797→    function detectNowCompeting(team) {\n  1798→      if (!team || !team.events) return null;\n  1799→\n  1800→      // Olympic order for events (already sorted in API, but just in case)\n  1801→      const events = team.events;\n  1802→\n  1803→      for (const event of events) {\n  1804→        const gymnasts = event.gymnasts || [];\n  1805→        if (gymnasts.length === 0) continue;\n  1806→\n  1807→        // Sort by order (lineup position)\n  1808→        const sortedGymnasts = [...gymnasts].sort((a, b) => (a.order || 0) - (b.order || 0));\n  1809→\n  1810→        // Find scored and unscored athletes\n  1811→        const scored = sortedGymnasts.filter(g => g.final_score != null);\n  1812→        const unscored = sortedGymnasts.filter(g => g.final_score == null);\n  1813→\n  1814→        // If this event has some scores but not all, it's in progress\n  1815→        if (scored.length > 0 && unscored.length > 0) {\n  1816→          return {\n  1817→            athlete: unscored[0],\n  1818→            event: event\n  1819→          };\n  1820→        }\n  1821→      }\n  1822→\n  1823→      return null; // No one currently competing (between rotations or complete)\n  1824→    }\n  1825→\n  1826→    /**\n  1827→     * Detect now-competing athletes for all teams and return results.\n  1828→     * @param {Array} apiTeams - Teams array from Virtius API\n  1829→     * @returns {Array} Array of { teamIndex, teamName, tricode, athlete, eventName }\n  1830→     */\n  1831→    function detectAllNowCompeting(apiTeams) {\n  1832→      if (!apiTeams || apiTeams.length === 0) return [];\n  1833→\n  1834→      const results = [];\n  1835→\n  1836→      apiTeams.forEach((team, teamIndex) => {\n  1837→        const nowCompeting = detectNowCompeting(team);\n  1838→        if (nowCompeting) {\n  1839→          results.push({\n  1840→            teamIndex: teamIndex,\n  1841→            teamKey: team.short_name || `team${teamIndex + 1}`,\n  1842→            teamName: team.name,\n  1843→            tricode: team.tricode,\n  1844→            athlete: {\n  1845→              id: nowCompeting.athlete.gymnast_id,\n  1846→              name: nowCompeting.athlete.full_name,\n  1847→              order: nowCompeting.athlete.order,\n  1848→              type: nowCompeting.athlete.type // 0=competing, 1=exhibition, etc.\n  1849→            },\n  1850→            eventName: nowCompeting.event.event_name\n  1851→          });\n  1852→        }\n  1853→      });\n  1854→\n  1855→      return results;\n  1856→    }\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5658113a-8744-4772-a894-2aa4e358d1ff","uuid":"52ef770d-d6a3-4ea8-a13a-21c50783e82a","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/juliacosmiano/code/gymnastics-graphics/overlays/team-bug.html","content":"    function detectNowCompeting(team) {\n      if (!team || !team.events) return null;\n\n      // Olympic order for events (already sorted in API, but just in case)\n      const events = team.events;\n\n      for (const event of events) {\n        const gymnasts = event.gymnasts || [];\n        if (gymnasts.length === 0) continue;\n\n        // Sort by order (lineup position)\n        const sortedGymnasts = [...gymnasts].sort((a, b) => (a.order || 0) - (b.order || 0));\n\n        // Find scored and unscored athletes\n        const scored = sortedGymnasts.filter(g => g.final_score != null);\n        const unscored = sortedGymnasts.filter(g => g.final_score == null);\n\n        // If this event has some scores but not all, it's in progress\n        if (scored.length > 0 && unscored.length > 0) {\n          return {\n            athlete: unscored[0],\n            event: event\n          };\n        }\n      }\n\n      return null; // No one currently competing (between rotations or complete)\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * Detect now-competing athletes for all teams and return results.\n     * @param {Array} apiTeams - Teams array from Virtius API\n     * @returns {Array} Array of { teamIndex, teamName, tricode, athlete, eventName }\n     */\n    function detectAllNowCompeting(apiTeams) {\n      if (!apiTeams || apiTeams.length === 0) return [];\n\n      const results = [];\n\n      apiTeams.forEach((team, teamIndex) => {\n        const nowCompeting = detectNowCompeting(team);\n        if (nowCompeting) {\n          results.push({\n            teamIndex: teamIndex,\n            teamKey: team.short_name || `team${teamIndex + 1}`,\n            teamName: team.name,\n            tricode: team.tricode,\n            athlete: {\n              id: nowCompeting.athlete.gymnast_id,\n              name: nowCompeting.athlete.full_name,\n              order: nowCompeting.athlete.order,\n              type: nowCompeting.athlete.type // 0=competing, 1=exhibition, etc.\n            },\n            eventName: nowCompeting.event.event_name\n          });\n        }\n      });\n\n      return results;\n    }","numLines":60,"startLine":1797,"totalLines":1960}}}
